sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ProjectEditorPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewMyProjectBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewMyProjectController
  participant InteriorDesignProject as «entity»<br/>InteriorDesignProject
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: view one of my IDPs
  UI->>B: GET /api/designer/projects/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer designerId, Integer projectId)
  alt IDP of another designer
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 404 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>InteriorDesignProject: findOwned()
  InteriorDesignProject->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>InteriorDesignProject: rows
  InteriorDesignProject-->>C: result
  C-->>B: DesignerProjectDetail
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end